## Hints for Future Agents
- PI_global.md is deliberately self-contained. Do not add provenance links to rules/* or references to other harnesses.
- Pi loads this file through the install.sh symlink at ~/.pi/agent/AGENTS.md.
- Keep top-level sections limited to Code Comments, Git Workflow, Engineering Principles, and Task Tracking unless the user explicitly changes the desired scope.
- Engineering Principles intentionally contains both general simplicity rules and the ordered subtractive process in one section.
- Do not run install.sh casually: it removes and recreates numerous global dotfile links beyond Pi configuration.

## Codebase Discoveries
- Pi's documented global context file is ~/.pi/agent/AGENTS.md; project context uses AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md discovered from the working directory upward.
- Pi has no documented .pi/rules/*.md auto-discovery mechanism.
- The repository already had unrelated unstaged modifications in .gitconfig_global, AGENTS_global.md, claude_settings.json, and codex_config.toml. They were not part of this commit.

